@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001
@token = replace-with-access-token
@callOffId = 1
@transportOrderId = 1

### Sent emails for a call-off
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/email/log/calloff/{{callOffId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sent emails for a transport order
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/email/log/transportorder/{{transportOrderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unsupported item type returns 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/email/log/unknown/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
